  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Death Backup 是一個模組，會在玩家死亡前將他們的物品欄儲存到世界資料夾中的檔案裡。如果玩家擁有作弊權限，可以透過指令 '<em>/deathbackup load <index></em>' 重新載入物品欄。'<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 會顯示所有最近的死亡紀錄及其索引，供玩家取回。物品欄會以玩家名稱建立資料夾儲存，因此無論是在伺服器環境還是單人遊戲中都能正常運作。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，當擁有作弊權限的玩家死亡時，會發送訊息通知他們已建立備份且可重新載入。<br><br><span><strong>backupReminderMessage</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"您的死亡前物品欄備份已建立，可透過 '/deathbackup load 0' 重新載入。\"<br>當 'sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath' 啟用時，發送給擁有作弊權限玩家的訊息。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/deathbackup</em> - 顯示可用指令。</span><br><span><em>/deathbackup list</em> - 顯示最近死亡紀錄及對應索引的列表。</span><br><span><em>/deathbackup load <index></em> - 從 '<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 中載入由 <em><index></em> 指定的死亡備份。索引 0 永遠是最新的死亡紀錄。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>每次玩家死亡時，其物品欄與裝備都會儲存至 '<em>./world-folder/data/deathbackup/time.txt</em>'。預設情況下，若玩家擁有作弊權限，系統會發送提醒訊息，但可在設定中關閉此功能。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>使用指令 '<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 即可查看所有近期的死亡備份。索引 0 永遠代表最新的紀錄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>使用 '<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>' 指令即可重新載入最新死亡前的物品欄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p>其他包含 NBT 標籤的物品範例，例如附魔與已撰寫的書本：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span>執行 '<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>' 即可順利載入最後一次物品欄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍維持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 存放庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
